<title>INDIA: India's CESC 96/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India's CESC 96/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA, India 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   413.5 vs    896.4</p>
<p>    Net sales	 13,382.9 vs 11,453.1</p>
<p>    Other income	 769.3 vs    543.3</p>
<p>    Expenditure     11,732.0 vs  9,339.7</p>
<p>    Interest	   1,305.7 vs  1,103.4</p>
<p>    Gross profit     1,114.5 vs  1,553.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation	 701.0 vs    657.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Calcutta Electricity Supply Corp Ltd (CESC) released the results in a statement.</p>
</text>
